TASK-213 runtime harness: the site settings popover's layout (host header,
Content Blocking, the picture in picture / dev mode section, Extensions) in a
Quick Detour and in the main window, plus a long host with 7 blocked and no
site. Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. Gated on DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR;
DETOUR_VERIFY_APPEARANCE light or dark; DETOUR_VERIFY_FIXTURE a loopback
server (python3 -I -m http.server 8936 over a dir with index.html, title
"Lookup Page"); DETOUR_VERIFY_EXT an unpacked MV3 extension with an action
popup ("Verify Probe"), installed and pinned in Default. Data dir
DetourVerify2130. Posted clicks (NSApp.postEvent) open the two real
popovers after 12 s of HID idle; the other two are the builder's popover
with made-up inputs on the address bar's button. Each step logs every
label, switch and divider top to bottom with its frame and any overlap.
run.sh is TASK-210's (SHOOT lines served with screencapture -l, only the
launched PID killed).

    git apply docs/harness/task213-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    run.sh light; run.sh dark
    git apply -R docs/harness/task213-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

Results (2026-10-26, light and dark): Quick Detour 280x234, two dividers,
one switch (Block content on this site); main window 280x315, three
dividers, the blocking switch then picture in picture and dev mode in their
own section; long host truncated in the middle, the badge reads 7 and the
count line "7 resources blocked on this page"; no site: "No site loaded" in
secondary, picture in picture and dev mode disabled. No overlaps, nothing
outside the popover.

